## Control {{controlId}}: Maintain audit logs of physical access.

**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

{{#if tenantName}}
{{tenantName}} maintains audit logs of physical access to facilities containing CUI systems. Physical access logs capture individual identity, date/time of access, and access point. Logs are retained in accordance with organizational retention policies and are available for review during security assessments.
{{/if}}

{{#if cloudEnvironment}}
For the {{cloudEnvironment}} cloud infrastructure, Microsoft maintains physical access audit logs for all data center facilities under their FedRAMP High authorization. These logs are available for audit upon request.
{{/if}}

{{#if cisoEmail}}
The ISSO ({{cisoEmail}}) reviews physical access logs periodically to identify unauthorized access attempts and ensures log retention meets NIST SP 800-171 requirements.
{{/if}}

